    "created_at": "2021-06-17T22:04:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-06-17T22:04:56Z",
    "body": "I was wrong, there is an origin check: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/local_frame.cc;l=1857\r\n\r\n(Notably the check is done synchronously for `location.href` assignment O_o...)",
